<title>UK: London auction sees better prices for best teas.</title>
<headline>London auction sees better prices for best teas.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monday's London tea auction saw increased prices for better liquoring Assams in good demand with other Assams holding their values, the official report said.</p>
<p>Brightest East Africans achieved higher prices but mediums tended easier.</p>
<p>Rates in the offshore sector were generally fully firm.</p>
<p>The next Monday auction is on January 6.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8071</p>
</text>
